			"notes": "## EnchantPeek 0.1.0\n\nInitial release for Minecraft 1.21.11.\n\n### Added\n\n- Added Fabric client mod support for previewing full enchantment table results before enchanting\n- Added local enchantment seed prediction for client-side previews\n- Added singleplayer support using the local server player's enchantment seed\n- Added optional Paper companion plugin for server-side enchantment previews\n- Added server preview validation against the active enchantment table state and input item\n- Added highest enchantment table level markers with `★`\n- Added optional Paper config for sending previews\n- Added optional Paper config for refreshing a player's enchantment seed when a new item is inserted\n- Added Traditional Chinese README\n\n### Notes\n\n- The Fabric client mod is required on the player client.\n- The Paper companion plugin is optional and only needs to be installed on servers that want server-side previews.\n- The `★` marker means the enchantment is the highest level available for that enchantment from the current enchantment table option."
		}
